    <patterns>
      <pattern name="Match-paraId → split-run-at-offset → wrap w:ins/w:del" location="projects/spaarkeai-compose-r4/notes/bridge-prior-art.md finding #6">
        Match `w:p` by `w14:paraId` → walk runs accumulating text length until the offset lands in run R → `Run.Clone()` split R preserving `RunProperties` → wrap inserts in `InsertedRun`(w:ins) / deletes in `DeletedRun`(w:del) with Author/Date/Id → mutate the DOM, never string-edit.
      </pattern>
      <pattern name="EDGE-1…4 native-OOXML wisdom" location="src/server/api/Sprk.Bff.Api/Services/Compose/DocxAnnotationWriter.cs">
        Comment-before-trackchange element ordering; `w:delText` (not `w:t`) inside a deleted run; monotonic revision-id seeding across a save. Migrate these; leave text-search behind.
      </pattern>
